#: ../../user/templates/waku.md
msgid "templates, waku, react server components, rsc, daishi kato"
msgstr "テンプレート, waku, react server components, rsc, daishi kato"

#: ../../user/templates/waku.md:7
msgid "Waku"
msgstr "Waku"

#: ../../user/templates/waku.md:9
msgid ""
"A minimal React Server Components app powered by Waku (by Daishi Kato). "
"The template ships both halves of the RSC boundary in ReScript: a Server "
"Component (`Greet.res`, no JS shipped) and a Client Component "
"(`Counter.res`, made client-side via a thin TSX `\"use client\"` "
"wrapper)."
msgstr ""
"Daishi Kato 製の Waku を採用した最小構成の React Server Components アプリです。テンプレートは RSC 境界の "
"両側を ReScript で提供します: Server Component (`Greet.res`、JS は配信されない) と "
"Client Component (`Counter.res`、薄い TSX `\"use client\"` ラッパー越しにクライアント化)。"

#: ../../user/templates/waku.md:11
msgid "Generated layout"
msgstr "生成されるレイアウト"

#: ../../user/templates/waku.md:28
msgid "Key files"
msgstr "主なファイル"

#: ../../user/templates/waku.md:30
msgid ""
"`src/pages/index.tsx` — Server Component (Waku's default for "
"`src/pages/`). Imports the ReScript `Greet` directly and the "
"`CounterClient` Client wrapper."
msgstr ""
"`src/pages/index.tsx` — Server Component (`src/pages/` 配下の Waku 既定)。ReScript の "
"`Greet` を直接、`CounterClient` Client ラッパーを併せて import します。"

#: ../../user/templates/waku.md:31
msgid ""
"`src/components/Greet.res` — Server Component body. Renders to HTML on "
"the server; ships zero JS for itself."
msgstr ""
"`src/components/Greet.res` — Server Component の本体。サーバー側で HTML にレンダリングされ、"
"このコンポーネントの JS は一切配信されません。"

#: ../../user/templates/waku.md:32
msgid ""
"`src/components/Counter.res` — Client Component body, written in ReScript"
" with `useState`."
msgstr ""
"`src/components/Counter.res` — `useState` を使った ReScript 製 Client Component の本体。"

#: ../../user/templates/waku.md:33
msgid ""
"`src/components/CounterClient.tsx` — Thin TSX wrapper that owns the "
"`\"use client\"` directive and re-exports the ReScript `make` function. "
"ReScript cannot emit `\"use client\"` itself, so this small file is the "
"canonical workaround."
msgstr ""
"`src/components/CounterClient.tsx` — `\"use client\"` ディレクティブを持ち、ReScript の `make` "
"関数を再エクスポートする薄い TSX ラッパー。ReScript 自身は `\"use client\"` を出力できないため、"
"この小さなファイルが正攻法のワークアラウンドになります。"

#: ../../user/templates/waku.md:35
msgid "npm scripts"
msgstr "npm スクリプト"

